## AutoCoder runtime
# Root-anchored: an unanchored `runs/` matches ANY directory named runs at
# any depth, which silently excluded src/AutoCoder.Core/Runs/ - three source
# files that the solution references. The repo built locally, where the files
# exist on disk, and failed for anyone who cloned it.
/runs/
# The actual runtime output directory, named explicitly rather than by a
# wildcard that also matches source folders.
src/AutoCoder.Server/runs/
.env
/autocoder.yml
*.db

